    <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <li><strong>Guangzhou South → Guilin North/West:</strong> 2.5 hours, ~170 RMB (2nd class). Most frequent — trains every 30-60 minutes</li>
      <li><strong>Shenzhen North → Guilin North:</strong> 3 hours, ~220 RMB</li>
      <li><strong>Hong Kong West Kowloon → Guilin West:</strong> 3.5 hours, ~350 HKD. Direct train — no need to cross into Shenzhen first</li>
      <li><strong>Beijing West → Guilin:</strong> 8-10 hours, ~800 RMB (2nd), ~450 RMB (flight — often cheaper)</li>
    </ul>
