  <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800">Common Mistakes</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-amber-900">
      <li><strong>Wrong station:</strong> Guilin has three stations — Guilin North, Guilin West, and Guilin (South). Check which one your ticket says. They're 20-30 minutes apart by taxi.</li>
      <li><strong>Booking too late:</strong> Trains sell out during holidays (Spring Festival, Golden Week, summer vacation). Book as soon as tickets open (15 days ahead).</li>
      <li><strong>Collecting tickets at the wrong window:</strong> Foreign passport holders often need to go to a staffed counter (not the self-service machines) to collect tickets. Look for the "Manual Service" or "Ticket Collection" counter.</li>
    </ul>
